  "scope": "Executed synthetic host byte grammar/state/mask algorithms and complete pristine/ON/OFF intermediate state/mask/probability/RNG fixtures. NOT-INFERENCE; no original-weight GPU continuation, memory fit or performance qualification.",
  "implementation": [
    "Model-neutral C17 ABI1 owns copied immutable rule/sequence/symbol/byte-class tables, owned stack/lexeme snapshots, alternative expansion, byte branching, prefix-and-complete handling, completion and canonical sorting/deduplication.",
    "Limits preserve8192 states,16384 stack symbols and2000000 expansion operations, with4160 primitive scratch bytes. Caller contexts outlive objects; paired fresh aligned allocator hooks support failures, default malloc/free. Refusal preserves caller inputs/output ownership, and valid dead prefixes remain distinct from errors.",
    "Dense/mapped logit masks preserve allowed nonfinite bit patterns, exact in-place operation and refuse invalid geometry/IDs/overlap before output mutation.",
    "Exact14 provider edits seal an independently owned C program after compilation and reasoning/tool composition, borrowing immutable primitive context from the composed object. ON/OFF private layouts agree; source-bound rebuilds are required. Storage/predicate/error bridge performs no rule runtime algorithm.",
    "Existing defaultON/OFF selection and provider receipt now bind12 sampling/grammar files and4 extraction recipes. Direct reference CMake resolves legacy sampler and byte-grammar methods; shared inline model/controller math remains in the archive. New GPU reference compilation/link/continuation remains unqualified.",
    "Schema compiler, exact-decimal/string/Unicode-DFA predicates, vocabulary trie/transition interning/shared mask cache and provider vector marshalling remain transitional. This is actual runtime extraction, not a claim of complete C grammar or autonomous model executor.",
    "No model/device/HTTP operation, RNG or runtime thread is created. Executor/request/generation ABIs, reactive owner/controller and DS4 RAM/SSD framing remain unchanged. No Python product/defaultCTest dependency."
  ],
  "coverage": [
    "134402 independent byte-language transitions classify all256 bytes over511 binary prefixes; recursion, duplicate alternatives, complete/dead prefixes and exact state counts are checked.",
    "Every construction/start/advance allocation can refuse without leaks, input mutation or output publication. Explicit state,stack and work-budget failures include a non-consuming cycle. Program table copies, primitive prefix+complete branching, canonical clone independence and bit-preserving dense/compact mask refusal pass.",
    "20 grammars and23 texts yield13700 complete byte-state witnesses and7089 full259-token masks. Schema predicates,recursive references,numeric decimal/string/Unicode constraints,reasoning,required/optional and parallel/nonparallel tools are compared against pristine Gufo and OFF.",
    "Existing1200 numerical/1200 biased/24 full-vocabulary/1728 history and1728compact/6912MTP decisions remain byte-exact with all previous witness hashes unchanged. Nine upstream numerical/grammar/MTP fixtures and two controls pass.",
    "Final19 Debug+19 ASan/UBSan/LeakSanitizer focused checks,17 sanitizer reference checks and35 public C++ headers pass. Final recipe/header rebuilds and2+2 focused contract/provider rechecks pass; no assertion/leak detection relaxation.",
    "Strict warning-as-error C17 compilation passes; imports are only stack protector,malloc/free,memcmp/memcpy. No qsort/thread/device symbol."
  ],
